      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T14:20:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "wdyt about letting this be Layout::kInvalid, and then having UniformManager assert that its layout is valid, vs. the current fail if kInvalid is passed in?\n\nOr have SkPipelineDataGatherer\u0027s ctor not take a layout at all?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 459,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 459,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "585b33a039d47c31be7b8552618e0be7a6344c4a",
